{"ts":"2026-07-06T21:57:38.146Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"aggregate is the only query-family command left without a consolidation child under pm-n7rr: it does grouped item counts, overlapping both list (filters/projections) and stats (totals, moving under pm ops per pm-6apl). Per ADR pm-pbyu (one noun per domain, projections are flags), fold it as a --group-by/--count-by projection on list, or as ops stats --by. Decide the exact spelling in-item against the grammar table, wire the alias shim via pm-0z7n, and follow the full wiring checklist (commands/index, register-mutation, mcp/server, sdk/cli-contracts, contracts.ts, completions, docs, vitest.config, contracts:update). Depends on the alias shim foundation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-xkgq"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Fold aggregate into the query nouns: pm list --group-by/--count-by (or ops stats --by), retire the aggregate top-level"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","cli-simplification"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:57:38.146Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:57:38.146Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":240},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Grouped-count queries are reachable from a consolidated noun (list or ops stats) with identical output fields; aggregate keeps working as a hidden alias emitting the one-line migration hint per ADR pm-pbyu; contracts/completions/docs/MCP regenerated; spelling-parity spec covers old vs new invocation"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value